+    """Declares fixed every parameter and buffer of `modules` (and their submodules), every tensor held as one of their
+    attributes or in a list or tuple attribute (KV caches, state, pre-made views), and `tensors`. A redo's body that reaches
+    one on the storage of a static-prefix argument reads it at its own layout on that argument's root (where several share
+    the storage, the one the op's recorded launches read); one that is a static-prefix argument resolves to it. Changing one
+    (set_, .data =, a layout change, a reassigned attribute) needs release() and statics_changed(), as a static prefix does."""
+    import torch
